window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Narrated by Elena Wolfe, Carly Robins, Shane East, Jacob Morgan, and Sebastian York, Dirty Filthy Rich is over 55 hours of audio in one bundle.</p> <p>The men of Reach aren’t your average CEOs. Yes, they’re worth billions. And each one is hotter than the last. Under the charming smiles, all of them are controlling, and often accused of abusing their power.</p> <p>But that’s just the boardroom. In the bedroom? They aren’t just rich, sexy, sweet, and wild. They’re dirty, filthy, and downright unforgettable. From age gaps to edge play and sweet to spicy—which one will claim your heart?</p> <p>For the first time, you can discover all the naughty secrets of the Reach men in the Dirty Universe bundle.</p> <p>Contains:</p> <p>Dirty Filthy Rich Men</p> <p>Dirty Filthy Rich Love</p> <p>Sweet Liar</p> <p>Sweet Fate</p> <p>Wild Rebel Wild War</p> <p>Wild Heart</p> <p>Kincaid</p>"; 
